  "goodToKnow": "Ungeniert means unabashed or without embarrassment: ungeniert zugreifen (help oneself freely), ungeniert lügen. It comes from French gêne, via sich genieren (to be embarrassed): Genier dich nicht! (don't be shy). The g is pronounced like the s in measure. Synonyms: unbekümmert, ohne Scheu, frech when disapproving."
